# 17️⃣ Field Evolution

```python
from matplotlib import animation

fig = plt.figure()

frames = []

for state in field:

    frame = plt.imshow(state, animated=True, cmap="plasma")

    frames.append([frame])

ani = animation.ArtistAnimation(fig, frames, interval=50)

plt.show()
```

